      "message": "\u003e Hello Benson, Chris, Chienyuan and Jack\n\u003e \n\u003e    Please review this change. It is not easy to reproduce this issue.\n\u003e    But this issue will cause bluetooth crash.\n\u003e    I think we should not depend on the result of previous operation to the database( the StorageModule seems like a database here ) in next operation.\n\u003e    Since other one may change the StorageModule state any time.",
